    "innovation": "This paper uses a 30-year analysis of the Castelporziano aquifer, integrating SPEI and SGI indices to demonstrate that rising temperatures and evapotranspiration, not reduced rainfall, are causing a significant groundwater decline linked to recent forest stress in the nature reserve.",
